{"step_index":594,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:51:02Z","input_tokens":213334,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1773,"thinking":"The request is to thoroughly verify and fill in initially blank phone number fields. This requires a comprehensive approach, leveraging all available resources for accurate data completion. The process must commence from the very beginning, ensuring no initial data is overlooked, and be conducted with meticulous attention to detail.\n\n\nInitial investigation reveals a significant number of missing phone numbers; previous searches have filled only a portion, highlighting a need for a broader approach. The discovery of Kakao Map's success with a previously missed company suggests exploring its API and other diverse sources like Naver, NiceBizInfo, and KFTC. The strategy will focus on rigorous source verification to prevent fabricated data, respecting access restrictions, and prioritizing a structured, plan-driven execution to ensure data integrity.\n\n\nConsidering sub-agent orchestration and QA inspection for phone number verification, a research phase commences to assess available platforms. Kakao Map Search API shows promise due to its comprehensive local business coverage and readily available phone numbers, which can be validated by address matching. Other potential sources including Naver, Bizno.net, Saramin, NiceBizInfo, and DART/Venturein will be evaluated. Testing the Kakao Map API on a sample of missing companies will determine its effectiveness.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nasync function testKakaoOnMissingSample() {\n  const missing = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('pure_missing_2658.json', 'utf8'));\n  const stage2 = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('stage2_results.json', 'utf8'));\n\n  // Filter those still completely missing in stage2\n  const stillMissing = missing.filter(m => !stage2[m.bizNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '')]);\n  console.log('Still missing count:', stillMissing.length);\n\n  const sample = stillMissing.slice(0, 30);\n  let kakaoFound = 0;\n\n  for (const item of sample) {\n    const cleanName = item.name.replace(/\\(주\\)|주식회사|\\(유\\)|\\(합\\)/g, '').trim();\n    const query = encodeURIComponent(cleanName + ' 부산');\n    const url = `https://search.map.kakao.com/mapsearch/map.daum?q=${query}&msFlag=A&sort=0`;\n\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(url, {\n        headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' }\n      });\n      const data = await res.json();\n      if (data.place && data.place.length > 0) {\n        // Find matching place by address or name\n        for (const p of data.place) {\n          if (p.tel && p.tel.trim().length > 0) {\n            // Check if address matches Busan or gu/dong\n            const pAddr = p.address + ' ' + (p.new_address || '');\n            const itemDong = (item.address.match(/([가-힣]+[구|동|로|길])/g) || []).slice(0, 3);\n            const addrMatch = itemDong.some(d => pAddr.includes(d));\n\n            if (addrMatch || p.name.includes(cleanName)) {\n              console.log(`[KAKAO MATCH] Seq ${item.seq} ${item.name} -> ${p.tel} (${p.name} / ${p.new_address || p.address})`);\n              kakaoFound++;\n              break;\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    } catch(e) {}\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 50));\n  }\n\n  console.log(`\\nSample 30 Kakao test: Found ${kakaoFound} / 30 (${(kakaoFound/30*100).toFixed(1)}%)`);\n}\n\ntestKakaoOnMissingSample();\n","Description":"Test Kakao Map API on missing companies sample","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\find_company_phone_numbers\\test_kakao_sample.js","toolAction":"Writing Kakao test script","toolSummary":"Test Kakao Map hit rate on missing companies"}}]}
